 "insight": [
  "The share of the top 3 import partners of Luxembourg changed notably from 2005 to 2025.",
  "Belgium's share increased from 26.9% to 30.0%, Germany's share rose from 20.3% to 25.0%, while China's share decreased from 12.4% to 3.0%.",
  "The most notable change was China's decline by 75.5% over this period.",
  "Belgium's imports peaked at 34.0% in 2018, and Germany's peaked at 26.2% in 2020.",
  "These values are nominal and not adjusted for price changes, which may affect comparisons over time."
 ],
